{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12108170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12108170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210817001:1":{"text":"見つけたぞ！滝が交わる場所！","source_cn":"找到了，瀑布汇流的地方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3EB3F07EB4C4EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210817002:0":{"text":"これは、見事だな。こんなに大きな滝は見たことがない。","source_cn":"壮观，我第一次见到这么大的瀑布。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x796FF4E31C7A0184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210817003:0":{"text":"四つの滝が交わる……歌詞とまったく同じだ！","source_cn":"简直……和民谣中记载的一模一样——四瀑汇流而下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0FBD9BB5CB90E3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210817004:0":{"text":"後半もその通りなら、滝の下に財宝があるはずですよね？","source_cn":"那么，按民谣的下半句，瀑布下面应该有宝藏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59B718D30BF337DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210817005:1":{"text":"でも、ここには滝しかないですよ。財宝の光どころか、渦もありません……","source_cn":"但是这里只有瀑布，没有大漩涡啊。更不用说宝藏和光了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2EF01E1EBDF185","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210817006:1":{"text":"渦は財宝へと続く扉だからな。扉ってことは、それを開く鍵が必要だろ？その鍵を手にする方法が試練なんだよ！","source_cn":"那是因为漩涡就是通往宝藏的门。要看到门，还需要钥匙！想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48F5ADE41592E153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210817007:1":{"text":"すごく詳しいですね……","source_cn":"辛巴达怎么懂这么多？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB79182F32CE98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210817008:1":{"text":"冒険譚ってのは大抵どれも似たり寄ったりだからな。","source_cn":"冒险故事里都是这么写的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x353D3F268868EB63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210817009:1":{"text":"お姉ちゃん！あっちを見て！あの石碑に文字が書いてあるよ！","source_cn":"姐姐！前面！那里有块石碑，上面好像有字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E52A3478476E4FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210817010:1":{"text":"？","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52B79F244F93B82C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"ソニア","source":"索尼娅","status":"matche